33227.a:
```yaml
# templates/_helpers.tpl
{{- define "api.fullname" -}}
{{- printf "%s-%s" .Release.Name .Chart.Name | trunc 63 | trimSuffix "-" -}}
{{- end -}}
{{- define "api.labels" -}}
app.kubernetes.io/name: {{ .Chart.Name }}
app.kubernetes.io/instance: {{ .Release.Name }}
{{- end -}}

# templates/deployment.yaml
metadata:
  name: {{ include "api.fullname" . }}
  labels:
    {{- include "api.labels" . | nindent 4 }}
spec:
  replicas: {{ .Values.replicas | default 2 }}
  template:
    spec:
      containers:
      - image: "{{ .Values.image.repo }}:{{ required "image.tag majburiy" .Values.image.tag }}"
        resources:
          {{- toYaml .Values.resources | nindent 10 }}
```
- `include` (`template` emas) — natijani pipe qilish mumkin (`nindent`).
- `required` — qiymat bo'lmasa render xato bilan to'xtaydi.
- `toYaml` — values'dagi blokni (resources, tolerations) aynan ko'chiradi.
- Indent xatolari eng ko'p uchraydi: `helm template` bilan tekshiring.
